   "lines": [
    "Sometimes, when",
    "I by accident",
    "think of him,",
    "it seems utterly",
    "impossible to",
    "realize that I",
    "shall never seem[?]",
    "him again, till",
    "we meet in",
    "that Better Land.",
    "It is as if part",
    "of myself had",
    "been taken away.",
    "Every event of",
    "my life is bound",
    "up with him;",
    "he was as pure",
    "and unselfish"
   ],
